{{!--
  customization-bay-content.hbs
  Canonical Droid Garage / Starship Shipyard content (Phase 2 structural
  flattening).

  This is the ONE Garage/Shipyard content source, consumed by both hosts:
    - Standalone: templates/apps/customization/customization-bay.hbs wraps
      this partial in the standalone-only device frame
      (.swse-customization-bay-standalone-frame).
    - Inline: CustomizationSurfaceAdapter.buildViewModel() renders this
      partial directly (no wrapper) as contentHtml for
      templates/shell/partials/surface-customization.hbs. The Holopad shell
      is already the outer device frame there, so Garage/Shipyard must not
      repaint a second one.

  PR #947 correction — this root intentionally does NOT carry swse-ui-shell
  or swse-sheet-ui. Both independently paint a full min-height:100% screen
  background AND an absolutely-positioned ::before page-frame SVG overlay
  (styles/ui/swse-holo-phase1.css), which is exactly the "second full-screen
  frame drawn inside the real one" this phase removes — carrying them here
  would have silently reintroduced it regardless of the standalone/inline
  wrapper split. swse-datapad is kept: audited to contribute only
  typography (color/font-family, already redundant with .swse-customization-
  bay's own), a GPU-acceleration hint, and two things this content actually
  needs — [data-swse-tooltip-key] focus-visible styling (used by
  .bay-context-pill and the systems-browser hint) and select/option theming
  (also independently covered by dedicated .swse-customization-bay select
  rules, but kept for defense in depth) — none of which paint any
  background, border, or frame chrome of their own.

  PR #947 final correction — data-application-content lives HERE, on the
  content root, not on the standalone frame wrapper. It was originally
  placed on .swse-customization-bay-standalone-frame so
  styles/apps/customization-bay.css could thread window-content's height
  chain down through it, but that made the SAME element simultaneously
  match ".swse-customization-bay-app [data-application-content]"
  (specificity 0,2,0) and ".swse-customization-bay-standalone-frame"
  (specificity 0,1,0) — so the higher-specificity window-content-sizing
  rule's padding:0/background:transparent silently won over the frame's
  own padding:18px/background, regardless of source order. Mirroring
  Workbench's actual structure (data-application-content on
  .swse-customization-screen, the CONTENT element, never on
  .swse-customization-stage, the frame/theme-scope element) fixes this by
  construction: the height-chain CSS now targets only the real Foundry
  .window-content ancestor, which is a different element than the frame,
  so there is no longer any rule competing with the frame's own chrome for
  the same element. This also preserves the repo-wide V13
  [data-application-content] contract (see
  scripts/apps/base/swse-application-v2.js's contentElement getter and
  scripts/governance/sentinel/appv2-interaction-auditor.js), which this
  content root satisfies in both the standalone and inline hosts.

  Phase 4 — information hierarchy + system browser UX. The center workspace
  is the primary activity (browse/search/filter available systems); the
  right rail is System Intel, the authoritative explanation of whatever is
  currently selected; the left rail is build-level context/status (target,
  credits, capacity, validation) — not a second browser or a pile of
  duplicated readiness panels. The old decorative Build Stages stepper (its
  active index was a hardcoded literal, never derived from real selection
  state) is gone, replaced by a Modification Status block sourced from the
  same preview/legality data every other panel already reads. Every
  data-action binding required by the frozen Phase 2 structural contract
  (tests/customization-bay-inline-structural-flattening.test.mjs) is still
  present; controls with no functioning action path beyond a "future
  integration" notice (Save Draft / Request GM Approval / Send to Store
  Quote) are demoted into a collapsed secondary-actions disclosure instead
  of being removed, since removing them would break that frozen contract.

  V2-safe shell: UI emits intents; engines own rules, costs, validation, and
  mutation.
--}}
<div class="swse-customization-bay swse-datapad"
     data-customization-bay-content
     data-application-content
     data-theme="{{themeKey}}"
     data-motion-style="{{motionStyle}}"
     data-mode="{{mode}}"
     data-context-mode="{{contextMode}}"
     style="{{{themeStyleInline}}}; {{{motionStyleInline}}};">
  <header class="bay-header">
    <div class="bay-header__identity">
      <span class="bay-header__glyph" aria-hidden="true">{{config.glyph}}</span>
      <div>
        <p class="bay-kicker">SWSE Customization Bay</p>
        <h1>{{modeLabel}}</h1>
        <p class="bay-subtitle">{{config.subtitle}}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <nav class="bay-mode-tabs" aria-label="Customization bay mode">
      {{#each modeOptions}}
        <button type="button"
                class="bay-mode-tab {{#if active}}active{{/if}}"
                data-action="set-mode"
                data-mode="{{key}}"
                aria-pressed="{{#if active}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}">
          <span class="bay-mode-tab__glyph" aria-hidden="true">{{glyph}}</span>
          <span>{{label}}</span>
        </button>
      {{/each}}
    </nav>
  </header>

  <section class="bay-context-strip" aria-label="Customization context">
    {{#each contextOptions}}
      <button type="button"
              class="bay-context-pill {{#if active}}active{{/if}}"
              data-action="set-context"
              data-context="{{key}}"
              data-swse-tooltip-key="{{tooltipKey}}"
              aria-pressed="{{#if active}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}">
        {{label}}
      </button>
    {{/each}}
  </section>

  <section class="bay-mentor bay-mentor--{{config.mentorClass}}">
    <div class="bay-mentor__portrait swse-mentor-hologram" aria-hidden="true">
      {{#if mentor.mentorPortrait}}
        <img class="swse-mentor-hologram__image" src="{{mentor.mentorPortrait}}" alt="">
      {{else}}
        <span>{{config.glyph}}</span>
      {{/if}}
      <span class="swse-mentor-hologram__tint"></span>
      <span class="swse-mentor-hologram__scan"></span>
    </div>
    <div class="bay-mentor__body">
      <div class="bay-mentor__meta">
        <strong>{{mentor.mentorName}}</strong>
        <span>{{mentor.mentorTitle}}</span>
        <span>Channel · {{config.mentorChannel}}</span>
        {{#if wallet.isOwnerFunded}}<span>Wallet · {{wallet.name}}</span>{{/if}}
      </div>
      <p data-customization-mentor-text
         data-mentor="{{mentor.mentorKey}}"
         data-raw-text="{{mentor.mentorText}}">{{mentor.mentorText}}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {{#if error}}
    <aside class="bay-runtime-note" data-tone="negative" role="alert">
      <strong>Unable to load this customization target:</strong> {{error}}
    </aside>
  {{/if}}

  <main class="bay-workgrid">
    <aside class="bay-left-rail">
      <section class="bay-panel bay-panel--status">
        <header class="bay-panel__head">
          <span>Modification Status</span>
          <strong>{{summaryName}}</strong>
        </header>
        <div class="bay-legal-rows">
          <div class="bay-legal-row"><span>Installed</span><strong>{{installedRows.length}}</strong></div>
          <div class="bay-legal-row"><span>Pending Additions</span><strong>{{pendingAdditionsCount}}</strong></div>
          <div class="bay-legal-row"><span>Pending Removals</span><strong>{{pendingRemovalsCount}}</strong></div>
        </div>
      </section>

      {{#unless error}}
      <section class="bay-panel bay-panel--credit">
        <header class="bay-panel__head">
          <span>Credits</span>
          <strong class="bay-value--{{budget.tone}}">{{budget.newCreditsLabel}}</strong>
        </header>
        <div class="bay-budget-bar">
          <span style="width: {{budget.usedPct}}"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="bay-budget-meta">
          <span>Wallet {{budget.currentCreditsLabel}}</span>
          <span>Cost {{budget.netCostLabel}}</span>
          <span class="bay-value--{{budget.tone}}">After {{budget.newCreditsLabel}}</span>
        </div>
      </section>
      {{/unless}}

      <section class="bay-panel bay-panel--validation">
        <header class="bay-panel__head">
          <span>Build Status</span>
          <strong class="bay-status bay-status--{{legality.tone}}">{{legality.label}}</strong>
        </header>
        {{#if legality.notes.length}}
          <ul class="bay-warning-list">
            {{#each legality.notes}}
              <li>{{this}}</li>
            {{/each}}
          </ul>
        {{else}}
          <p class="bay-muted">Ready to apply.</p>
        {{/if}}
        <button type="button" class="bay-section-action" data-action="validate-build">Refresh Preview</button>
      </section>
    </aside>

    <section class="bay-main">
      <section class="bay-section">
        <header class="bay-section__head">
          <h2>Core Profile</h2>
          <span>{{summaryName}}</span>
        </header>
        <div class="bay-stat-grid">
          {{#each profileStats}}
            <article class="bay-stat bay-stat--{{tone}}">
              <span>{{label}}</span>
              <strong>{{value}}</strong>
            </article>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
      </section>

      {{#if techSpecialist.canUse}}
      <section class="bay-section bay-section--tech-specialist">
        <header class="bay-section__head bay-section__head--actions">
          <h2>Tech Specialist</h2>
          <div class="bay-section__actions">
            <span>{{techSpecialist.walletName}} modifying {{techSpecialist.subjectName}}</span>
            <button type="button" class="bay-section-action" data-action="open-tech-specialist" {{#unless techSpecialist.canInstall}}disabled{{/unless}}>Install Trait</button>
            {{#if techSpecialist.canDesignateSignature}}<button type="button" class="bay-section-action" data-action="designate-signature-device">Make Signature Device</button>{{/if}}
          </div>
        </header>
        <p class="bay-muted">{{techSpecialist.hint}}</p>
        {{#if techSpecialist.installedTraits.length}}
        <div class="bay-card-grid">
          {{#each techSpecialist.installedTraits}}
          <article class="bay-part-card bay-part-card--tech {{#if active}}installed{{/if}}">
            <div class="bay-part-card__head"><strong>{{name}}</strong><span>{{tier}}</span></div>
            <p>{{benefit}}</p>
            <button type="button" class="bay-part-card__action" data-action="toggle-tech-signature-trait" data-trait-id="{{id}}">{{#if active}}Active{{else}}Set Active{{/if}}</button>
          </article>
          {{/each}}
        </div>
        {{/if}}
      </section>
      {{/if}}

      <section class="bay-section bay-section--browser">
        <header class="bay-section__head bay-section__head--actions">
          <h2>{{#if (eq mode 'shipyard')}}Vehicle Systems{{else}}Droid Systems{{/if}}</h2>
          <div class="bay-section__actions">
            <span data-swse-tooltip-key="{{#if (eq mode 'shipyard')}}shipyard.systemBays{{else}}garage.systems{{/if}}">Available Systems</span>
            <button type="button" class="bay-section-action" data-action="browse-systems">
              {{#if (eq mode 'shipyard')}}Browse Ship Systems{{else}}Browse New Droid Systems{{/if}}
            </button>
          </div>
        </header>

        {{#if garageFocus}}
          <aside class="bay-runtime-note" data-tone="neutral">
            <strong>Garage focus:</strong> {{garageFocus.label}}
          </aside>
        {{/if}}

        {{#if error}}
          <p class="bay-muted bay-browser-empty">Systems are unavailable for this customization target.</p>
        {{else}}
          <div class="bay-browser-toolbar">
            <div class="bay-browser-search">
              <input type="text" name="systemSearch" class="bay-browser-search__input" placeholder="Search systems" aria-label="Search systems" value="{{browser.search}}">
              <button type="button" class="bay-browser-search__submit" data-action="apply-system-search">Search</button>
              {{#if browser.hasActiveFilters}}<button type="button" class="bay-browser-search__reset" data-action="reset-system-filters">Reset</button>{{/if}}
            </div>
            <div class="bay-browser-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter by category">
              {{#each browser.categoryFilters}}
                <button type="button" class="bay-filter-pill {{#if active}}active{{/if}}" data-action="set-system-category-filter" data-value="{{key}}" aria-pressed="{{#if active}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}">{{label}}</button>
              {{/each}}
            </div>
            <div class="bay-browser-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter by status">
              {{#each browser.statusFilters}}
                <button type="button" class="bay-filter-pill {{#if active}}active{{/if}}" data-action="set-system-status-filter" data-value="{{key}}" aria-pressed="{{#if active}}true{{else}}false{{/if}}">{{label}}</button>
              {{/each}}
            </div>
          </div>

          {{#if browser.groups.length}}
            <div class="bay-system-groups">
              {{#each browser.groups}}
                <section class="bay-system-group" data-category="{{key}}">
                  <h3>{{label}}</h3>
                  <div class="bay-card-grid">
                    {{#each systems}}
                      <article class="bay-part-card bay-part-card--{{category}} {{#if installed}}installed{{/if}} {{#if selectedAdd}}selected-add{{/if}} {{#if selectedRemove}}selected-remove{{/if}} {{#unless compatible}}incompatible{{/unless}} {{#if selected}}inspecting{{/if}}"
                               data-action="inspect-system"
                               data-system-id="{{id}}">
                        <div class="bay-part-card__head">
                          <strong>{{name}}</strong>
                          <span class="bay-part-card__badge bay-part-card__badge--{{badgeTone}}">{{stateLabel}}</span>
                        </div>
                        <p class="bay-part-card__category">{{categoryLabel}}</p>
                        <p>{{description}}</p>
                        <div class="bay-part-card__meta">
                          <span>{{costLabel}}</span>
                          {{#if slot}}<span>Slot: {{slot}}</span>{{/if}}
                        </div>
                        <button type="button"
                                class="bay-part-card__action"
                                data-action="{{action}}"
                                data-system-id="{{id}}"
                                {{#if actionDisabled}}disabled{{/if}}>
                          {{actionLabel}}
                        </button>
                      </article>
                    {{/each}}
                  </div>
                </section>
              {{/each}}
            </div>
          {{else}}
            <p class="bay-muted bay-browser-empty">
              {{#if browser.search}}No systems match &quot;{{browser.search}}&quot;.{{else}}No systems match the current filters.{{/if}}
              {{#if browser.hasActiveFilters}}<button type="button" class="bay-browser-search__reset" data-action="reset-system-filters">Reset filters</button>{{/if}}
            </p>
          {{/if}}
        {{/if}}
      </section>
    </section>

    <aside class="bay-right-rail">
      <section class="bay-summary bay-summary--intel">
        <header>
          <span>System Intel</span>
        </header>

        {{#if intel}}
          <div class="bay-intel">
            <div class="bay-intel__head">
              <strong>{{intel.name}}</strong>
              <span class="bay-part-card__badge bay-part-card__badge--{{intel.badgeTone}}">{{intel.stateLabel}}</span>
            </div>
            <p class="bay-part-card__category">{{intel.categoryLabel}}</p>
            <p class="bay-intel__desc">{{intel.description}}</p>
            <div class="bay-legal-rows">
              <div class="bay-legal-row"><span>Cost</span><strong>{{intel.costLabel}}</strong></div>
              {{#if intel.slot}}<div class="bay-legal-row"><span>Slot</span><strong>{{intel.slot}}</strong></div>{{/if}}
              <div class="bay-legal-row"><span>Compatible</span><strong>{{#if intel.compatible}}Yes{{else}}No{{/if}}</strong></div>
            </div>
            {{#if intel.blockingReason}}<p class="bay-warning-inline">{{intel.blockingReason}}</p>{{/if}}
            {{#if intel.note}}<p class="bay-muted">{{intel.note}}</p>{{/if}}
            <button type="button"
                    class="bay-part-card__action"
                    data-action="{{intel.action}}"
                    data-system-id="{{intel.id}}"
                    {{#if intel.actionDisabled}}disabled{{/if}}>
              {{intel.actionLabel}}
            </button>
          </div>
        {{else}}
          <p class="bay-muted bay-intel-empty">Select a system to inspect its specifications, installation requirements, and projected effect.</p>
        {{/if}}

        {{#if installedRows.length}}
          <div class="bay-installed-list">
            <h3>Installed</h3>
            {{#each installedRows}}
              <button type="button" class="bay-installed bay-installed--{{category}} {{#if selected}}inspecting{{/if}}" data-action="inspect-system" data-system-id="{{id}}">
                <span>{{name}}</span>
                <strong>{{categoryLabel}}</strong>
              </button>
            {{/each}}
          </div>
        {{/if}}

        <div class="bay-summary__actions">
          <button type="button" data-action="reset-build" {{#unless hasChanges}}disabled{{/unless}}>Reset</button>
        </div>

        <details class="bay-secondary-actions">
          <summary>More Actions</summary>
          <div class="bay-secondary-actions__buttons">
            <button type="button" data-action="save-draft">Save Draft</button>
            <button type="button" data-action="request-gm-approval">Request GM Approval</button>
            <button type="button" data-action="store-quote">Send to Store Quote</button>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>
    </aside>
  </main>

  <footer class="bay-footer">
    <div class="bay-breadcrumbs">
      <span>Customization Bay</span>
      <span>{{modeLabel}}</span>
    </div>
    <div class="bay-footer__actions">
      <button type="button" data-action="close-bay">Back / Close</button>
      <button type="button" data-action="apply-build" class="primary" {{#unless canApply}}disabled{{/unless}}>Apply Changes</button>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <details class="bay-implementation-notes">
    <summary>Build Guidance</summary>
    <ul>
      <li>Installs and removals are staged as a draft — nothing changes on the actor until you choose Apply Changes.</li>
      <li>Removed systems may return resale credit; the Credits summary shows the current projection.</li>
      <li>Credits are drawn from the wallet named in the mentor strip above, which may not be this actor's own balance.</li>
      <li>Blocked builds show the current reason in Build Status.</li>
    </ul>
  </details>
</div>
